## Title: EllesmereUI |cff0cd29fPet Auras (Party Frames)|r
## Notes: Buffs and debuffs on the EllesmereUI Raid Frames party pet frames. Separate, freely positioned buff and debuff blocks with adjustable icon size, timer, timer size and font, and an option to hide auras with no duration. Works in combat. Settings: Raid Frames > Party > PET AURAS. Move mode: /papf
